    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d531">

                <pb facs="0512" n="502" xml:id="pg502"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00B/3–1749: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-03-17T15:00:00-05:00">March 17, 1949—3
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>354. Pls obtain available info and report by tel to Dept ur estimate extent
                    Commies have succeeded reorganizing and integrating into own forces Nat Govt
                    forces surrendered or defected to them past 6 months.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
